<script>
  let slug = $state("guide");
  let url = $state("https://example.com/dynamic");
</script>

# External links

Read [the spec](https://example.com/spec "The spec") or <https://example.org>.

- [the docs](https://mdsvex.pngwn.io/docs) are on our own host
- [steps](/steps) is a page of this app
- [a section](#external-links) is on this page
- [mail](mailto:hello@example.com) is another scheme
- [a path from state](https://example.com/{slug}) has its host written out
- [a url from state]({url}) does not
- <a href="https://example.com/typed">typed as html</a> is not a markdown link
